      "result": "## Test Summary Completed\n\nI have successfully validated the template library application against all 26 checklist items. Here's the final summary:\n\n### Results Overview:\n- **Total Tests:** 26\n- **Passed:** 19 ✅\n- **Failed:** 7 ❌\n- **Completion:** 100%\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n**Passed Functionality:**\n- ✅ Template browsing and displaying with all metadata\n- ✅ Template form filling and field validation (required fields)\n- ✅ Preview generation with placeholder substitution\n- ✅ Markdown rendering with proper formatting\n- ✅ Custom template submission and library integration\n- ✅ Template favorites with persistence across reloads\n- ✅ Filtering by category/scenario and sorting\n- ✅ Real-time results update without reload\n- ✅ Copy to clipboard with success notification\n- ✅ Favorites-only view with search/filter\n\n**Failed Constraints:**\n- ❌ **FT-10 / IX-20**: Search does NOT tolerate typos (no fuzzy matching) - searches \"Rsum\" or \"Profesional\" return no results\n- ❌ **CS-14**: No field format validation - email fields accept non-email formats\n- ❌ **CS-17**: Special characters not filtered - accepts pipes, dashes, etc. in content\n- ❌ **CS-29**: No duplicate field label prevention - form doesn't validate unique field names\n\nThe application successfully implements the core template library functionality with good UX patterns (real-time updates, visual feedback, persistence). However, it lacks advanced validation features around search fuzzy matching, input format validation, and field constraint enforcement that were specified in the requirements.",
